// Per-task stack overflow canary (boot/stack_canary.S) -- see that
// file's own header comment for the full "why" (four historical
// silent-stack-overflow incidents, no MMU guard page possible at this
// project's current 1MB section granularity). set_base is called once
// per task, at boot, right after that task's stack is allocated;
// check_all runs once per real timer tick from irq_dispatch below.
